# Testing

## Stack

- Unit tests: `test` / `flutter_test`
- BLoC tests: `bloc_test` + `mocktail`
- Fakes: `packages/testing` (`FakeRepository`, BLoC helpers)

## Coverage Targets

- 80% for `domain/` and `data/` layers per feature package
- No `test/` at app level — test packages, not apps

## Patterns

| Layer | Approach |
|-------|----------|
| UseCase | Test with `FakeRepository` from `packages/testing` |
| BLoC | `blocTest` + `MockRepository` via `mocktail` |
| Repository | Test `TaskEither` via `.run()` |
| Widget | Wrap with `AppTheme.light()` + `ScreenUtilInit` |

## File Structure

Mirror source: `lib/src/x.dart` → `test/src/x_test.dart`
Golden tests: store in `test/goldens/`; regenerate with `--update-goldens`
